    "title": "Monkey - random video chat",
    "description": "Monkey makes it easy to meet new people and make new friends online. Created by 5 teens in LA, Monkey embraces making friends over social media and created a space to do just that. With over 30 million users worldwide, we\u2019ve created a space that embraces individuality and self-discovery. Monkey is the fastest, easiest, and most fun way to meet new people all over the world. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Personalized Profiles \ud83c\udf1f\r\nGive your profile a vibe with a custom mood and a profile song that auto-plays when people see your card\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udccf Cards \ud83c\udccf\r\nStart swiping through Cards to add new friends\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 Video Chat \ud83d\udcf7 \r\nEngage in authentic conversations with cool people\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc6b DUO Chat \ud83d\udc6b\r\nGroup video chat with your friends\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac Text Chat \ud83d\udcac\r\nQuickly DM with new people\r\n\r\nFollow us\r\nSnap @monkeyapp\r\nIG @monkey \r\nTwitter @monkey\r\n\r\nQuestions? Contact us at hello@monkey.app",
